| Renderer files scanned | ${report.selectorCoverage.fileCount} |
| data-testid occurrences | ${report.selectorCoverage.testIdCount} |
| Interactive tags scanned | ${report.selectorCoverage.interactiveTagCount} |
| Inline selector coverage | ${Math.round(report.selectorCoverage.inlineSelectorCoverage * 100)}% |

## External Tool Readiness

| Package | Installed | Role |
| --- | --- | --- |
${tools}

## Reliability Aggregation

This is a deterministic fixture oracle, not a real-provider, human, or generalization result.

| Metric | Value | Numerator | Denominator |
| --- | ---: | ---: | ---: |
| pass^k (all k trials succeed) | ${displayMetric(reliability.passAtK)} | ${reliability.passAtK.numerator} | ${reliability.passAtK.denominator} |
| pass@k (at least one succeeds) | ${displayMetric(reliability.passAt1)} | ${reliability.passAt1.numerator} | ${reliability.passAt1.denominator} |
| Per-trial success rate | ${displayMetric(reliability.trialSuccessRate)} | ${reliability.trialSuccessRate.numerator} | ${reliability.trialSuccessRate.denominator} |
| Flake rate | ${displayMetric(reliability.flake)} | ${reliability.flake.numerator} | ${reliability.flake.denominator} |
| Raw cases | ${reliability.denominators.rawCases} | - | - |
| Complete cases | ${reliability.denominators.completeCases} | - | - |
| Incomplete cases | ${reliability.incomplete.cases} | - | - |

Incomplete status counts: missing=${reliability.incomplete.reasons.missing}, timeout=${reliability.incomplete.reasons.timeout}, crash=${reliability.incomplete.reasons.crash}, skip=${reliability.incomplete.reasons.skip}. Gate: **${reliability.gate}**. Reasons: ${reliability.reasons.length ? reliability.reasons.join('; ') : 'none'}.

## Interpretation

- The current in-repo implementation already gives agents ${report.agentDev.scenarioCount} deterministic page entry points and ${report.agentDev.e2eHelperCount} E2E helpers without depending on new packages.
- Schema assertions now reject malformed agent-dev payloads at the Main host-api boundary.
- Basic a11y and visual artifact generation are available through Playwright today; axe/Argos can replace the fallback scanners once supply-chain policy allows installing them.
- The selector coverage metric is a heuristic. It is useful as a trend line, not as a precise accessibility or E2E quality proof.
- Reliability values above exercise deterministic fixture aggregation only; they do not establish real-provider, human, or out-of-fixture generalization.
